		{"id":"a68ec7a0b09cbe39","type":"text","text":"### new repo\n- don't have permissions\n- we put zip to `/home/jen/public/repos`\n- jen do some stuff behind and do commit","x":7753,"y":4162,"width":540,"height":160},
		{"id":"0e2010ca6caa83f0","type":"text","text":"# git hooks abuse\n- git hooks directory contain scripts to execute like : post-commit, pre-commit etc\n- we created .git/hooks/post-commit with revshell code\n- make zip and put in `/home/jen/public/repos`\n- user jen will extract and will run hooks script `post-commit`","x":7773,"y":4602,"width":580,"height":220},
